// design names all four as words this vocabulary will take, and each arrives
// with the slice that can actually make a creature do it, the way a Verb value
// arrives the day the SDK gates the verb. A value no engine could produce
// would be a promise this contract cannot keep, and a client would grow a
// branch for it that never runs.
//
