	// never renumbered. Two members receiving the same beat therefore carry
	// DIFFERENT numbers here, and neither number names anything in the other's
	// stream: comparing seqs across recipients is meaningless, and the only
	// question this field answers is "did MY next number arrive". The dense
	// numbering is what makes that question honest — a member never observes a
	// hole, however much of the shared story retention has trimmed underneath
	// (ruled on rpg-project#351, built in rpg-toolkit#1377).
