	// a host-driven result can carry one — the SDK's Spawn output is the case
	// that exists, and its Seq is the record's, not any member's. Those are
	// different spaces. Copied here, such a number lands in the client's stream
	// as a gap or a repeat, and the client resyncs against a hole that was never
	// there.
